  "locales": {
    "es": {
      "nij": {
        "p01": {
          "heading_html": "\n        Dos normas.<br>Funciones distintas.\n      ",
          "text_0dc098a9e1": "01 / Entender la actualización",
          "text_fa3b7daf98": "Para entender la nueva clasificación, hay que leer\n        estos dos documentos de forma conjunta.",
          "text_e86a48a4ea": "Cómo se evalúa",
          "text_e2266a9ddb": "Establece requisitos de desempeño y métodos de\n            ensayo para la protección balística del torso.",
          "text_033add5aba": "Consultar la norma y sus adendas ↗",
          "text_a2c1711c03": "Contra qué se evalúa",
          "text_4814564cd3": "Define niveles de protección, proyectiles y\n            velocidades de referencia. No establece por sí\n            sola los métodos de ensayo.",
          "text_36fa6dbc99": "Consultar niveles y amenazas ↗"
        },
        "p02": {
          "heading_html": "\n        El antes y el ahora,<br>frente a frente.\n      ",
          "text_9a977d8cb2": "IIA no se incluye en la nueva clasificación.",
          "text_0ec74ae744": "Se conservan las amenazas y velocidades nominales.",
          "text_9064dcf31d": "El 9 mm sustituye al .357 SIG. El .44 Magnum mantiene 240 gr; cambia la especificación de SJHP a JHP.",
          "text_9caf6ecd0a": "Se amplía de una a tres amenazas de rifle.",
          "text_9f5bf68397": "Nuevo nivel intermedio: todas las amenazas RF1 más M855.",
          "text_fa1627b84b": "Se mantiene M2 AP como amenaza de ensayo.",
          "text_b48094c679": "02 / Comparativa",
          "text_9fd6405a9e": "Cada norma tiene su propia columna de munición.\n        Así puedes identificar lo que se conserva,\n        se sustituye o se incorpora.",
          "text_059c4cbe4c": "Mostrar todos los niveles",
          "text_1c107a9007": "Mostrar niveles de arma corta",
          "text_03f3b18b1b": "Mostrar niveles de rifle",
          "text_bd02b9a7d7": "Todos",
          "text_26430a896a": "Arma corta",
          "text_ae9aaeb419": "Velocidad de referencia en m/s",
          "text_475d0066c5": "Comparativa NIJ 0101.06 y NIJ 0101.07 con NIJ 0123.00",
          "text_aa769de13a": "ANTES · NIJ 0101.06",
          "text_d8359ae31e": "AHORA · NIJ 0101.07 + NIJ 0123.00",
          "text_ba8ae5fc30": "Qué cambió",
          "text_ee50666c45": "Nivel",
          "text_58c26b6bae": "Munición de prueba · velocidad",
          "text_4f68d58956": "NUEVO",
          "text_611b814552": "Sin antecedente directo.",
          "text_cd13792fd2": "Sin nivel sucesor en la nueva clasificación.",
          "text_668d86d71b": "Las correspondencias de nomenclatura no implican equivalencia\n      automática de certificación. En NIJ 0101.06 se muestran las\n      velocidades de blindaje nuevo para IIA, II y IIIA; se omiten\n      las velocidades reducidas de muestras acondicionadas.\n      Los iconos son ilustrativos y no están a escala.",
          "text_540f43d5bd": "Leer las precisiones técnicas y abreviaturas",
          "text_eac3cece2f": "proyectil encamisado.",
          "text_bafff04a36": "punta redonda.",
          "text_9455878f70": "punta plana.",
          "text_3c87666be1": "punta blanda encamisada.",
          "text_bd68108d88": "punta hueca semiencamisada.",
          "text_49c2465a24": "punta hueca encamisada.",
          "text_250efd0774": "núcleo de acero dulce.",
          "text_22d840c11a": "perforante.",
          "text_346fa4b80a": "grains, unidad de masa.",
          "text_470dff77a4": "El .44 Magnum mantiene una masa de 240 gr.\n          Para M80 en RF1/RF2, la adenda 1 de NIJ 0123.00\n          especifica 149 +0/−3 gr; para M193, 56 +0/−2 gr;\n          para M855, 61.8 ±1.5 gr.\n          Las velocidades son referencias de ensayo,\n          no velocidades máximas de protección.",
          "text_0966138929": "El número y distribución de impactos dependen del ensayo\n          y de la configuración. Esta tabla no representa por sí\n          sola el protocolo completo de certificación ni una\n          garantía frente a cualquier munición del mismo calibre.",
          "text_02f4413ccf": "Fuentes oficiales:",
          "text_3fb5ff7099": "NIJ 0123.00 y adendas ↗",
          "mobile_before": "ANTES · NIJ 0101.06",
          "mobile_now": "AHORA · NIJ 0101.07 + NIJ 0123.00"
        },
        "p03": {
          "heading_html": "\n        <span class=\"ars-tests__word\">También</span>\n        <span class=\"ars-tests__word\">cambia</span><br>\n        <span class=\"ars-tests__word\">la</span>\n        <span class=\"ars-tests__word\">forma</span>\n        <span class=\"ars-tests__word\">de</span>\n        <span class=\"ars-tests__word\">evaluar.</span>\n      ",
          "text_58149e2998": "03 / Pruebas y evaluación",
          "text_d59fb95b47": "La actualización explora zonas y geometrías relevantes\n        del blindaje e incorpora métodos de ensayo ASTM.",
          "text_a83e5b7b77": "Panel flexible con seis puntos y un séptimo impacto cerca del borde superior, con trayectoria punteada ascendente.",
          "text_447be3ea8c": "Paneles flexibles",
          "text_a990e838bc": "Un séptimo impacto",
          "text_a4e36ceb41": "Se incorpora un disparo a 45° cerca del centro\n          del borde superior en la evaluación P-BFD,\n          en paneles planos y no planos.",
          "text_2777cb32c8": "Esquema conceptual de placa curva con la corona señalada en naranja.",
          "text_22b9b5980e": "CORONA",
          "text_a5bc2b8d49": "Placas multicurvas",
          "text_082240a0af": "Evaluar la corona",
          "text_09344b5fb9": "La distribución de impactos incluye la corona,\n          un punto alto de la superficie de impacto\n          definido por la geometría de la placa.",
          "text_743d3a3d10": "Figura femenina con panel de protección delineado en naranja.",
          "text_7e9ec44599": "Diseños femeninos",
          "text_721def8d2f": "La forma también cuenta",
          "text_c79dfa3d40": "Se mejora el soporte de los paneles no planos\n          sobre el respaldo de ensayo y la evaluación\n          de sus características de conformación.",
          "text_72c702b60e": "Esquemas conceptuales para explicar los cambios;\n      no reproducen el montaje completo de un ensayo.\n      P-BFD: evaluación de perforación y deformación posterior."
        },
        "p04": {
          "heading_html": "\n        <span class=\"ars-paneles__word\">Conoce</span>\n        <span class=\"ars-paneles__word\">nuestros</span><br>\n        <span class=\"ars-paneles__word\">paneles</span>\n        <span class=\"ars-paneles__word\">certificados.</span>\n      ",
          "text_6e008cf1b4": "Consulta la documentación del modelo y las opciones de integración para tu institución.",
          "text_9ad586da33": "Solicita asesoría sobre el nivel certificado y la configuración correspondiente al modelo.",
          "panel_alt": "Panel balístico {{ model }} de Arsenal Protection Mexico",
          "panel_link": "Consultar el panel {{ model }}",
          "panel_missing": "Imagen del panel {{ model }} no disponible.",
          "text_58a2a2c3da": "GR507 y GR407: modelos con certificación bajo\n        NIJ 0101.07, de acuerdo con la información de\n        Arsenal Protection Mexico.",
          "text_3c8caafcff": "Panel balístico"
        },
        "p05": {
          "heading_html": "\n          <span class=\"ars-componentes__word\">Cada</span>\n          <span class=\"ars-componentes__word\">componente</span>\n          <span class=\"ars-componentes__word\">tiene</span>\n          <span class=\"ars-componentes__word\">una</span>\n          <span class=\"ars-componentes__word\">función.</span>\n        ",
          "text_afa9298d17": "Mostrar panel con funda YUMA",
          "text_ceb9ab9635": "Mostrar panel sin funda",
          "text_9a3f09810a": "Panel femenino con funda negra YUMA sobre maniquí.",
          "text_886e42587a": "Panel femenino sin funda, con material amarillo visible sobre maniquí.",
          "text_3b3d747833": "Del panel a su funda",
          "text_0717af5f2f": "Explora las fotografías del panel femenino y de su\n          funda de YUMA de 200 deniers, respetando la forma\n          y los acabados del producto.",
          "text_b130129879": "Con funda YUMA",
          "text_cfc3df4e99": "Sin funda",
          "text_fcb4f2c6aa": "Funda de YUMA de 200 deniers: tejido negro mate\n            y acabado perimetral visible.",
          "text_781fd0c648": "Panel sin funda: vista de su conformación\n            y de los acabados visibles del conjunto.",
          "text_f0eab58f66": "Estas vistas no asignan un modelo ni un nivel\n          de protección al panel femenino mostrado.",
          "image_missing": "Imagen no disponible."
        },
        "p06": {
          "heading_html": "\n        <span class=\"ars-verificacion__word\">Una</span>\n        <span class=\"ars-verificacion__word\">prueba</span>\n        <span class=\"ars-verificacion__word\">y</span>\n        <span class=\"ars-verificacion__word\">una</span>\n        <span class=\"ars-verificacion__word\">certificación</span>\n        <span class=\"ars-verificacion__word\">tienen</span>\n        <span class=\"ars-verificacion__word\">alcances</span>\n        <span class=\"ars-verificacion__word\">distintos.</span>\n      ",
          "text_d80aa503b3": "05 / Información verificable",
          "text_95a398de22": "La certificación corresponde a un modelo específico\n        e incluye la evaluación y el seguimiento del\n        programa NIJ CTP.",
          "text_3d833ba526": "Consultar la lista oficial NIJ",
          "text_0ff0bedb06": "(se abre en una pestaña nueva)",
          "text_ab6a1f8eae": "Identifica el modelo",
          "text_ce9367c6b0": "Revisa la designación exacta del producto\n            y su etiqueta.",
          "text_bae826306a": "Consulta la lista CPL",
          "text_e75a19bdbb": "Verifica fabricante, norma, nivel y estado\n            del modelo.",
          "text_57047fc295": "Revisa la configuración",
          "text_2f71a2857d": "Solicita la documentación aplicable al sistema\n            que vas a adquirir."
        },
        "p07": {
          "heading_html": "\n          <span class=\"ars-faq__word\">Respuestas</span><br>\n          <span class=\"ars-faq__word\">para</span>\n          <span class=\"ars-faq__word\">decidir</span><br>\n          <span class=\"ars-faq__word\">con</span>\n          <span class=\"ars-faq__word\">claridad.</span>\n        ",
          "text_823f38be06": "06 / Preguntas frecuentes",
          "text_ca248b2ab4": "¿Mi equipo NIJ 0101.06 queda obsoleto?",
          "text_c382947ebf": "No automáticamente. NIJ prevé mantener la lista\n              NIJ 0101.06 al menos hasta finales de 2029. Esa fecha\n              no determina la vida útil de cada equipo:\n              revisa su condición, las indicaciones del fabricante\n              y las políticas de tu institución.",
          "text_80fb04f409": "¿HG2 es exactamente lo mismo que IIIA?",
          "text_5e72a4baf1": "No es una equivalencia automática. HG2 es la nueva\n              designación asociada al anterior IIIA, pero cambian\n              amenazas y métodos de ensayo. Un modelo certificado\n              bajo NIJ 0101.06 no obtiene por ello certificación\n              bajo NIJ 0101.07.",
          "text_6e0cb0a5fe": "¿Qué incorpora el nuevo nivel RF2?",
          "text_e803e5b029": "RF2 incluye las tres amenazas de RF1:\n              7.62 × 51 mm M80, 7.62 × 39 mm MSC y\n              5.56 mm M193. Añade la munición 5.56 mm M855,\n              con velocidad de referencia de 950 m/s.",
          "text_b7c482df44": "¿NIJ 0101.07 también certifica cascos y escudos?",
          "text_9968dc8975": "No. NIJ 0101.07 establece requisitos y métodos\n              de ensayo para blindaje corporal del torso.\n              Su certificación no se extiende a cascos ni escudos;\n              esos productos requieren normas y evaluaciones\n              aplicables a su categoría.",
          "text_d33e4c6eab": "¿RF3 se prueba contra todas las amenazas anteriores?",
          "text_80e077a551": "No dentro de la clasificación RF3 por sí sola.\n              Su amenaza de ensayo es .30-06 M2 AP,\n              con velocidad de referencia de 878 m/s.\n              Para confirmar evaluaciones frente a otras\n              municiones, consulta la documentación\n              específica del modelo.",
          "text_abaf846ec7": "Fuentes y actualizaciones",
          "text_990500cb51": "Fuentes y actualizaciones · Revisión: octubre de 2026",
          "text_3e816aae45": "NIJ 0101.06, PDF en una pestaña nueva",
          "text_56b7c81412": "NIJ 0101.07 y adendas, en una pestaña nueva",
          "text_419f8ba064": "NIJ 0101.07 y adendas",
          "text_d360dedeb9": "NIJ 0123.00 y adendas, en una pestaña nueva",
          "text_16bae4774f": "NIJ 0123.00 y adendas",
          "text_ecceae51d4": "Programa NIJ CTP, en una pestaña nueva",
          "text_6f165404be": "Programa NIJ CTP",
          "text_b2828923a7": "Resumen informativo. Para especificaciones de adquisición\n        y ensayos, consulta los documentos completos y sus adendas."
        },
        "p08": {
          "heading_html": "\n        <span class=\"ars-asesoria__word\">Define</span>\n        <span class=\"ars-asesoria__word\">la</span>\n        <span class=\"ars-asesoria__word\">protección</span>\n        <span class=\"ars-asesoria__word\">que</span>\n        <span class=\"ars-asesoria__word\">necesita</span>\n        <span class=\"ars-asesoria__word\">tu</span>\n        <span class=\"ars-asesoria__word\">institución.</span>\n      ",
          "text_09e5ae652f": "Panel balístico GR507",
          "text_12277648c2": "Panel balístico GR407",
          "text_02de5cf09d": "Panel balístico femenino",
          "text_e3842f57c7": "Chalecos y configuraciones",
          "text_1e862c3020": "Otro equipamiento",
          "text_dffb8597e6": "Asesoría sobre NIJ 0101.07",
          "text_6fc24e2993": "Asesoría para instituciones",
          "text_fc092e8937": "Cuéntanos qué equipamiento buscas. Te ayudamos\n        a revisar niveles, configuraciones y documentación.",
          "text_b7b917753d": "Atención a instituciones públicas y privadas.",
          "text_b9f89ca48a": "Tu solicitud se ha enviado correctamente.\n            Gracias por contactar a Arsenal Protection Mexico.",
          "text_5aaa9d597d": "Revisa los siguientes datos:",
          "text_15d38639ee": "Nombre completo *",
          "text_1a928a29a5": "Empresa o dependencia *",
          "text_49f37f515c": "Correo electrónico *",
          "text_408019c9f6": "Teléfono *",
          "text_f8a95e81b8": "Producto de interés *",
          "text_a150d4a325": "Selecciona una opción",
          "text_f8494badc9": "¿Qué necesita tu institución? *",
          "text_90d010e771": "Cantidad estimada, configuración o documentación que necesitas",
          "text_29ceb3833a": "Los campos marcados con * son obligatorios.\n          Utilizaremos tus datos para atender tu solicitud.",
          "text_6c678902b8": "Consulta nuestro aviso de privacidad.",
          "text_065d3702c0": "Enviar solicitud de asesoría"
        }
      }
    },
    "en": {
      "nij": {
        "p01": {
          "heading_html": "Two standards.<br>Different roles.",
          "text_0dc098a9e1": "01 / Understanding the update",
          "text_fa3b7daf98": "To understand the new classification, these two documents need to be read together.",
          "text_e86a48a4ea": "How it is tested",
          "text_e2266a9ddb": "Sets performance requirements and test methods for ballistic protection of the torso.",
          "text_033add5aba": "Read the standard and its addenda ↗",
          "text_a2c1711c03": "What it is tested against",
          "text_4814564cd3": "Defines protection levels, projectiles and reference velocities. It does not establish test methods on its own.",
          "text_36fa6dbc99": "View protection levels and test threats ↗"
        },
        "p02": {
          "heading_html": "Before and now,<br>side by side.",
          "text_9a977d8cb2": "IIA is not included in the new classification.",
          "text_0ec74ae744": "The test threats and nominal velocities are retained.",
          "text_9064dcf31d": "9 mm replaces .357 SIG. The .44 Magnum retains its 240 gr mass; the specification changes from SJHP to JHP.",
          "text_9caf6ecd0a": "Expanded from one to three rifle test threats.",
          "text_9f5bf68397": "A new intermediate level: all RF1 threats plus M855.",
          "text_fa1627b84b": "M2 AP remains the test threat.",
          "text_b48094c679": "02 / Comparison",
          "text_9fd6405a9e": "Each standard has its own ammunition column, making it easier to see what stays, what changes and what is added.",
          "text_059c4cbe4c": "Show all levels",
          "text_1c107a9007": "Show handgun levels",
          "text_03f3b18b1b": "Show rifle levels",
          "text_bd02b9a7d7": "All",
          "text_26430a896a": "Handgun",
          "text_ae9aaeb419": "Reference velocity in m/s",
          "text_475d0066c5": "Comparison of NIJ 0101.06 and NIJ 0101.07 with NIJ 0123.00",
          "text_aa769de13a": "BEFORE · NIJ 0101.06",
          "text_d8359ae31e": "NOW · NIJ 0101.07 + NIJ 0123.00",
          "text_ba8ae5fc30": "What changed",
          "text_ee50666c45": "Level",
          "text_58c26b6bae": "Test ammunition · velocity",
          "text_4f68d58956": "NEW",
          "text_611b814552": "No direct predecessor.",
          "text_cd13792fd2": "No successor level in the new classification.",
          "text_668d86d71b": "Corresponding level names do not imply automatic certification equivalence. For NIJ 0101.06, the velocities shown for IIA, II and IIIA apply to new armor; reduced velocities for conditioned samples are omitted. Icons are illustrative and not to scale.",
          "text_540f43d5bd": "Read technical notes and abbreviations",
          "text_eac3cece2f": "full metal jacket.",
          "text_bafff04a36": "round nose.",
          "text_9455878f70": "flat nose.",
          "text_3c87666be1": "jacketed soft point.",
          "text_bd68108d88": "semi-jacketed hollow point.",
          "text_49c2465a24": "jacketed hollow point.",
          "text_250efd0774": "mild steel core.",
          "text_22d840c11a": "armor piercing.",
          "text_346fa4b80a": "grains, a unit of mass.",
          "text_470dff77a4": "The .44 Magnum retains a mass of 240 gr. For M80 in RF1/RF2, Addendum 1 to NIJ 0123.00 specifies 149 +0/−3 gr; for M193, 56 +0/−2 gr; and for M855, 61.8 ±1.5 gr. These are test reference velocities, not maximum protection velocities.",
          "text_0966138929": "The number and placement of shots depend on the test and configuration. This table alone does not represent the full certification protocol or guarantee protection against every round of the same caliber.",
          "text_02f4413ccf": "Official sources:",
          "text_3fb5ff7099": "NIJ 0123.00 and addenda ↗",
          "mobile_before": "BEFORE · NIJ 0101.06",
          "mobile_now": "NOW · NIJ 0101.07 + NIJ 0123.00"
        },
        "p03": {
          "heading_html": "<span class=\"ars-tests__word\">The</span> <span class=\"ars-tests__word\">way</span> <span class=\"ars-tests__word\">we</span> <span class=\"ars-tests__word\">test</span> <br> <span class=\"ars-tests__word\">is</span> <span class=\"ars-tests__word\">changing</span> <span class=\"ars-tests__word\">too.</span>",
          "text_58149e2998": "03 / Testing and evaluation",
          "text_d59fb95b47": "The update examines relevant armor areas and geometries and incorporates ASTM test methods.",
          "text_a83e5b7b77": "Soft armor panel with six points and a seventh shot near the top edge, with a dotted upward trajectory.",
          "text_447be3ea8c": "Soft armor panels",
          "text_a990e838bc": "A seventh shot",
          "text_a4e36ceb41": "A shot at 45° near the center of the top edge is added to P-BFD testing of planar and nonplanar panels.",
          "text_2777cb32c8": "Conceptual diagram of a curved plate with its crown marked in orange.",
          "text_22b9b5980e": "CROWN",
          "text_a5bc2b8d49": "Multi-curve plates",
          "text_082240a0af": "Testing the crown",
          "text_09344b5fb9": "Shot placement includes the crown, a high point on the strike face defined by the plate's geometry.",
          "text_743d3a3d10": "Female figure with a protective panel outlined in orange.",
          "text_7e9ec44599": "Female armor designs",
          "text_721def8d2f": "Shape matters too",
          "text_c79dfa3d40": "Support for nonplanar panels on the test backing is improved, along with evaluation of their shaping features.",
          "text_72c702b60e": "Conceptual diagrams explaining the changes; they do not reproduce a complete test setup. P-BFD: perforation and backface deformation testing."
        },
        "p04": {
          "heading_html": "<span class=\"ars-paneles__word\">Explore</span> <span class=\"ars-paneles__word\">our</span> <br> <span class=\"ars-paneles__word\">certified</span> <span class=\"ars-paneles__word\">panels.</span>",
          "text_6e008cf1b4": "Review the model's documentation and integration options for your institution.",
          "text_9ad586da33": "Request guidance on the model's certified protection level and configuration.",
          "panel_alt": "Arsenal Protection Mexico {{ model }} ballistic panel",
          "panel_link": "View the {{ model }} panel",
          "panel_missing": "Image unavailable for panel {{ model }}.",
          "text_58a2a2c3da": "GR507 and GR407: models certified to NIJ 0101.07, according to information from Arsenal Protection Mexico.",
          "text_3c8caafcff": "Ballistic panel"
        },
        "p05": {
          "heading_html": "<span class=\"ars-componentes__word\">Every</span> <span class=\"ars-componentes__word\">component</span> <span class=\"ars-componentes__word\">has</span> <span class=\"ars-componentes__word\">a</span> <span class=\"ars-componentes__word\">purpose.</span>",
          "text_afa9298d17": "Show panel with YUMA cover",
          "text_ceb9ab9635": "Show panel without cover",
          "text_9a3f09810a": "Female armor panel with a black YUMA cover on a mannequin.",
          "text_886e42587a": "Female armor panel without its cover, showing yellow material on a mannequin.",
          "text_3b3d747833": "From panel to cover",
          "text_0717af5f2f": "Explore photographs of the female armor panel and its 200-denier YUMA cover, preserving the product's shape and finishes.",
          "text_b130129879": "With YUMA cover",
          "text_cfc3df4e99": "Without cover",
          "text_fcb4f2c6aa": "200-denier YUMA cover: matte black fabric with a visible perimeter finish.",
          "text_781fd0c648": "Panel without cover: a view of its shape and visible assembly finishes.",
          "text_f0eab58f66": "These views do not assign a model or protection level to the female armor panel shown.",
          "image_missing": "Image unavailable."
        },
        "p06": {
          "heading_html": "<span class=\"ars-verificacion__word\">Testing</span> <span class=\"ars-verificacion__word\">and</span> <span class=\"ars-verificacion__word\">certification</span> <span class=\"ars-verificacion__word\">have</span> <span class=\"ars-verificacion__word\">different</span> <span class=\"ars-verificacion__word\">scopes.</span>",
          "text_d80aa503b3": "05 / Verifiable information",
          "text_95a398de22": "Certification applies to a specific model and includes evaluation and ongoing oversight under the NIJ CTP.",
          "text_3d833ba526": "View the official NIJ list",
          "text_0ff0bedb06": "(opens in a new tab)",
          "text_ab6a1f8eae": "Identify the model",
          "text_ce9367c6b0": "Check the exact product designation and its label.",
          "text_bae826306a": "Check the CPL",
          "text_e75a19bdbb": "Verify the manufacturer, standard, protection level and model status.",
          "text_57047fc295": "Review the configuration",
          "text_2f71a2857d": "Request the documentation applicable to the system you intend to purchase."
        },
        "p07": {
          "heading_html": "<span class=\"ars-faq__word\">Answers</span> <span class=\"ars-faq__word\">for</span> <br> <span class=\"ars-faq__word\">clear</span> <span class=\"ars-faq__word\">decisions.</span>",
          "text_823f38be06": "06 / Frequently asked questions",
          "text_ca248b2ab4": "Is my NIJ 0101.06 equipment now obsolete?",
          "text_c382947ebf": "Not automatically. NIJ plans to maintain the NIJ 0101.06 list until at least the end of 2029. That date does not determine the service life of individual equipment: check its condition, the manufacturer's instructions and your institution's policies.",
          "text_80fb04f409": "Is HG2 exactly the same as IIIA?",
          "text_5e72a4baf1": "There is no automatic equivalence. HG2 is the new designation associated with the former IIIA level, but test threats and methods change. A model certified to NIJ 0101.06 does not automatically receive NIJ 0101.07 certification.",
          "text_6e0cb0a5fe": "What does the new RF2 level add?",
          "text_e803e5b029": "RF2 includes the three RF1 threats: 7.62 × 51 mm M80, 7.62 × 39 mm MSC and 5.56 mm M193. It adds 5.56 mm M855 ammunition at a reference velocity of 950 m/s.",
          "text_b7c482df44": "Does NIJ 0101.07 also certify helmets and shields?",
          "text_9968dc8975": "No. NIJ 0101.07 sets requirements and test methods for torso body armor. Its certification does not extend to helmets or shields; those products require standards and evaluations applicable to their category.",
          "text_d33e4c6eab": "Is RF3 tested against all the preceding threats?",
          "text_80e077a551": "Not under the RF3 classification alone. Its test threat is .30-06 M2 AP at a reference velocity of 878 m/s. To confirm testing against other ammunition, consult the documentation for the specific model.",
          "text_abaf846ec7": "Sources and updates",
          "text_990500cb51": "Sources and updates · Reviewed: October 2026",
          "text_3e816aae45": "NIJ 0101.06, PDF in a new tab",
          "text_56b7c81412": "NIJ 0101.07 and addenda, in a new tab",
          "text_419f8ba064": "NIJ 0101.07 and addenda",
          "text_d360dedeb9": "NIJ 0123.00 and addenda, in a new tab",
          "text_16bae4774f": "NIJ 0123.00 and addenda",
          "text_ecceae51d4": "NIJ CTP program, in a new tab",
          "text_6f165404be": "NIJ CTP program",
          "text_b2828923a7": "Informational overview. For procurement and testing specifications, consult the complete documents and their addenda."
        },
        "p08": {
          "heading_html": "<span class=\"ars-asesoria__word\">Define</span> <span class=\"ars-asesoria__word\">the</span> <span class=\"ars-asesoria__word\">protection</span> <span class=\"ars-asesoria__word\">your</span> <span class=\"ars-asesoria__word\">institution</span> <span class=\"ars-asesoria__word\">needs.</span>",
          "text_09e5ae652f": "GR507 ballistic panel",
          "text_12277648c2": "GR407 ballistic panel",
          "text_02de5cf09d": "Female armor panel",
          "text_e3842f57c7": "Vests and configurations",
          "text_1e862c3020": "Other equipment",
          "text_dffb8597e6": "NIJ 0101.07 guidance",
          "text_6fc24e2993": "Guidance for institutions",
          "text_fc092e8937": "Tell us what equipment you need. We can help you review protection levels, configurations and documentation.",
          "text_b7b917753d": "Serving public and private institutions.",
          "text_b9f89ca48a": "Your request has been sent successfully. Thank you for contacting Arsenal Protection Mexico.",
          "text_5aaa9d597d": "Please check the following details:",
          "text_15d38639ee": "Full name *",
          "text_1a928a29a5": "Company or agency *",
          "text_49f37f515c": "Email address *",
          "text_408019c9f6": "Phone number *",
